                            <comment id="16885422" author="prabhjyotsingh" created="Mon, 15 Jul 2019 17:09:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jongyoul&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;jongyoul&quot;&gt;jongyoul&lt;/a&gt; I&apos;ve created a new issue, so it can be discussed here.&lt;br/&gt;
I see one of two possible solutions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;add that URL in Settings | Language &amp;amp; Framework | Schemas and DTDs&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;or change all of
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&amp;lt;project xmlns=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;https:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0&quot;&lt;/span&gt; xmlns:xsi=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;https://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;         xsi:schemaLocation=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;https:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/maven-v4_0_0.xsd&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&amp;lt;project xmlns=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;http:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0&quot;&lt;/span&gt; xmlns:xsi=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;  xsi:schemaLocation=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;http:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;What do you recommend? &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16885993" author="jongyoul" created="Tue, 16 Jul 2019 09:40:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=prabhjyotsingh&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;prabhjyotsingh&quot;&gt;prabhjyotsingh&lt;/a&gt; Thanks for taking it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve tried to set URL in Settings but it still occurs error like&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12974809/12974809_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m not sure why this happens.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thus I recommend the second option.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;WDYT?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
